CREATE TABLE "PlanLimit" ("plan" TEXT NOT NULL,"maxClients" INTEGER NOT NULL,"maxQuotesPerMonth" INTEGER NOT NULL,"maxUsers" INTEGER NOT NULL,"customPdf" BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT false,"projectManagement" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'basic',"advancedReports" BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT false,"monthlyPriceCents" INTEGER NOT NULL,"quarterlyPriceCents" INTEGER NOT NULL,"semiannualPriceCents" INTEGER NOT NULL,"annualPriceCents" INTEGER NOT NULL,CONSTRAINT "PlanLimit_pkey" PRIMARY KEY ("plan"));
CREATE TABLE "Subscription" ("id" TEXT NOT NULL,"tenantId" TEXT NOT NULL,"plan" TEXT NOT NULL,"period" TEXT NOT NULL,"amountCents" INTEGER NOT NULL,"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'active',"startsAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL,"expiresAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CONSTRAINT "Subscription_pkey" PRIMARY KEY ("id"));
